{"id":"dummheit","lemma":"Dummheit","pos":"noun","rank":3842,"glosses":["stupidity"],"ipa":"/ˈdʊmhaɪ̯t/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c7/De-Dummheit.ogg/De-Dummheit.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Dummheit","plural":"Dummheiten"},"examples":[{"text":"Wer würde solch eine Dummheit machen?","en":"Who would do such a stupid thing?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"dignity"},{"g":"such"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to make"}]},{"text":"Kinder sagen oft Dummheiten.","en":"Children often say stupid things.","words":[{"g":"kid","l":"Kind"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce"},{"g":"often"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe letzte Nacht eine Dummheit gemacht.","en":"I did a stupid thing last night.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"last"},{"g":"night"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]},{"text":"Aber mach keine Dummheiten. Okay?","en":"Just don't do anything stupid, OK?","words":[{"g":"but"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"OK"}]},{"text":"Das war eine ganz schöne Dummheit!","en":"That was a pretty stupid thing to do.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"entire"},{"g":"well, beautifully","l":"schön"},null]}]}